###

### Here we can test time limit validation by setting short time limit and trying to submit attempt after that.
### Old attemps have their own time limits since it was set here.
### An attempt takes time limit from an assesment and never has its own time limit.

POST {{ReDI.Assessment.Api_HostAddress}}/api/assessments
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"title": "   Trimmed assessment title   ",
	"description": "   description with spaces   ",
	"timeLimitMinutes": 30
}

###

POST {{ReDI.Assessment.Api_HostAddress}}/api/assessments
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"title": "Assessment length limits test",
	"description": "Description is optional and limited",
	"timeLimitMinutes": 30
}

